# Environment Variables

Copy this to `.env.local` and fill in your values.

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=huwr3nhe
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production
NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_API_VERSION=2024-01-01

# Canonical site URL (no trailing slash). Defaults to https://hopyardaleworks.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Resend API key for contact form email delivery
# (the sending domain hopyardaleworks.com must be verified in Resend)
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Contact form recipients. The form reports an error to visitors if these are missing.
CONTACT_APPLETON_EMAIL=
CONTACT_FALLS_EMAIL=
CONTACT_MEDIA_EMAIL=

# Sanity webhook secret for on-demand ISR
SANITY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
```
